==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gmh|de}} {{term|wāge|lang=gmh}}, from {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wāga|lang=goh}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*wēgǭ}}, {{m|gem-pro|*wēgō||weight; balance, scale}}. The second ''a'' was introduced in 1927 to distinguish it from ''[[Wagen]]''. More at {{l|en|wey}}.

